guyen"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcBYh4nIGI_text","label":"ggcBYh4nIGI_text","default":"BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtngNKWWQu_text","label":"ggtngNKWWQu_text","default":"<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggE__6m2YTT_text","label":"ggE__6m2YTT_text","default":"<p>ND- Women's Hormone Expert</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi9sRuURjw_text","label":"ggi9sRuURjw_text","default":"<p>Kevin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxnhJNQlzj_text","label":"ggxnhJNQlzj_text","default":"Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHmb9yEBaW_text","label":"ggHmb9yEBaW_text","default":"<p>Kevin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVGKS8U0Ov_text","label":"ggVGKS8U0Ov_text","default":"<p>Founder &amp; Biohacking Enthusiast</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglHP47PWP__text","label":"gglHP47PWP__text","default":"<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglS2_8b3hf_text","label":"gglS2_8b3hf_text","default":"Rachel Nguyen"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6qH3vkBig_text","label":"gg6qH3vkBig_text","default":"BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJWHTvsQ3B_text","label":"ggJWHTvsQ3B_text","default":"Elizabeth Ross"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmek_OkGAD_text","label":"ggmek_OkGAD_text","default":"OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGQ2iBSNsm_text","label":"ggGQ2iBSNsm_text","default":"<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnVxyizYzO_text","label":"ggnVxyizYzO_text","default":"<p>ND- Women's Hormone Expert</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"grmBWWhzjPHPx_text","label":"grmBWWhzjPHPx_text","default":"Dr. Claire Thompson"},{"type":"html","id":"gSkhsfTSjvgBa_text","label":"gSkhsfTSjvgBa_text","default":"ND- Women's Hormone Expert"},{